('112.3.b.6.A',3,'Objects are sorted into two groups: SMOOTH and BUMPY. Which property is used?','["size", "color", "texture", "shape"]'::jsonb,2,'Smooth and bumpy tell how objects feel.','original'),
('112.3.b.6.A',2,'Which object is the LIGHTEST?','["a brick", "a book", "an apple", "a feather"]'::jsonb,3,'A feather weighs the least of these objects.','original'),
