('112.3.b.6.A',4,'Which object is LARGER than a marble but SMALLER than a basketball?','["a beach ball", "a grain of rice", "a baseball", "a pea"]'::jsonb,2,'A baseball is bigger than a marble and smaller than a basketball.','original'),
